      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\t          General Bugs\n\n
        - Screen not working:\n\"setvar DESKTOP_STATE on\" in terminal.\n\n - Timezone
        incorrect:\n\"setvar TIMEZONE uk\"\n\n - LAVA:\n\"addvar LAVA /etc/lava\"\nOR
        \"setvar LAVA /etc/lava\"\n\n - Trojan:\nrm etc/horse/trojan.exe\n\nALWAYS
        TYPE reboot AFTER CHANGES\n\n\n\n\n\t\n\n\t     Thanks For Reading\n\t\t 
        My Manual\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"
